<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-DEWULF FACES BRAZIL'S KUERTEN IN SEMIFINALS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DEWULF FACES BRAZIL'S KUERTEN IN SEMIFINALS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Filip Dewulf will meet Brazilian Gustavo Kuerten in Friday's semifinals of the the French Open.</p>
<p>Kuerten, ranked 66th in the world, knocked out defending champion Yevgeny Kafelnikov 6-2 5-7 2-6 6-0 6-4 in the quarter-finals on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dewulf beat Sweden's Magnus Norman 6-2 6-7 6-4 6-3.</p>
</text>
